{"id":70446,"date":"2026-10-22T21:53:24","date_gmt":"2026-10-22T20:53:24","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=70446"},"modified":"2026-10-22T21:55:06","modified_gmt":"2026-10-22T20:55:06","slug":"trail-das-andorinhas","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-das-andorinhas\/","title":{"rendered":"X &#8211; Trail das Andorinhas 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">X &#8211; Trail das Andorinhas 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>X &#8211; Trail das Andorinhas 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no domingo, <strong>13 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong>, com secretariado, partida e meta instalados no <strong>Parque Desportivo das Andorinhas<\/strong>, na freguesia de <strong>Sobradelo da Goma<\/strong>, concelho da <strong>P\u00f3voa de Lanhoso<\/strong> (distrito de <strong>Braga<\/strong>). Na sua <strong>10\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o<\/strong>, a prova integra oficialmente o <strong>Circuito Regional de Trail da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Braga<\/strong> (\u00e9poca 2026\/2027), consolidando-se como um dos desafios de inverno mais emblem\u00e1ticos do Minho.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa desportivo arranca \u00e0s <strong>08:45<\/strong> com o <strong>Trail Kids<\/strong> gratuito (escal\u00f5es de Benjamins A\/B e Infantis com <strong>1000 m<\/strong> e Iniciados e Juvenis com <strong>2500 m<\/strong>), seguindo-se o exigente <strong>Trail Longo de 28 km<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>09:30<\/strong> e o <strong>Trail Curto de 16 km<\/strong> em simult\u00e2neo com a <strong>Caminhada de 5 km<\/strong> a partir das <strong>09:45<\/strong>. Os percursos serpenteiam pelas encostas gran\u00edticas, bosques aut\u00f3ctones e vales rurais da serra da <strong>P\u00f3voa de Lanhoso<\/strong> \u2014 terra hist\u00f3rica do imponente <strong>Castelo de Lanhoso<\/strong> e da tradicional filigrana \u2014 exigindo autossufici\u00eancia h\u00eddrica, manta t\u00e9rmica e respeito ambiental.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizado pelo <strong>Grupo Desportivo da Goma<\/strong> em parceria com o <strong>Munic\u00edpio da P\u00f3voa de Lanhoso<\/strong> e a <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Braga<\/strong>, o evento garante cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica, seguro desportivo, banhos quentes, abastecimentos l\u00edquidos e s\u00f3lidos em corrida e no final, bem como oferta alusiva \u00e0 10\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o para inscri\u00e7\u00f5es confirmadas at\u00e9 29 de novembro. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">13 de Dezembro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Parque Desportivo das Andorinhas, Sobradelo da Goma, P\u00f3voa de Lanhoso, Braga<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12p