splay: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada 5K<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 13 Dez \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:45<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase (Com direito a oferta oficial):<\/strong> 6,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 29\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase (Agravamento ap\u00f3s 29\/11):<\/strong> 11,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 06\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail Kids<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Trail Kids (Benjamins e Infantis)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 13 Dez \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 08:45<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Gratuita (Nascidos entre 2013 e 2019):<\/strong> 0,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 06\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail Kids<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Trail Kids (Iniciados e Juvenis)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 13 Dez \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 08:45<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Gratuita (Nascidos entre 2009 e 2012):<\/strong> 0,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 06\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o X &#8211; Trail das Andorinhas 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O X &#8211; Trail das Andorinhas 2026 (10\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no domingo, 13 de dezembro de 2026, com secretariado, partida e chegada no Parque Desportivo das Andorinhas, em Sobradelo da Goma, concelho da P\u00f3voa de Lanhoso (distrito de Braga).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e hor\u00e1rios de partida do Trail das Andorinhas 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento inclui o Trail Kids (1000 m para Benjamins\/Infantis e 2500 m para Iniciados\/Juvenis) \u00e0s 08:45, o Trail Longo de 28 km com partida \u00e0s 09:30, e o Trail Curto de 16 km e a Caminhada de 5 km a partir das 09:45.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">At\u00e9 29 de novembro de 2026, os valores s\u00e3o de 18,00 \u20ac para o Trail Longo 28 km (14,00 \u20ac para federados AABraga), 15,00 \u20ac para o Trail Curto 16 km (12,00 \u20ac para federados AABraga), 6,00 \u20ac para a Caminhada de 5 km e gratuito para o Trail Kids. Entre 30 de novembro e 6 de dezembro de 2026 aplica-se um agravamento de 5,00 \u20ac nas provas pagas.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite (cut-off) e o material aconselhado?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O tempo m\u00e1ximo de conclus\u00e3o \u00e9 de 5 horas para o Trail Longo (28 km) e de 4 horas para o Trail Curto (16 km). Como a organiza\u00e7\u00e3o n\u00e3o disponibiliza copos descart\u00e1veis nos abastecimentos, \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio levar reservat\u00f3rio de \u00e1gua (m\u00ednimo 1L no Trail Longo e 0,5L no Trail Curto), telem\u00f3vel e manta t\u00e9rmica.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem organiza o evento e o que est\u00e1 inclu\u00eddo na inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova \u00e9 organizada pelo Grupo Desportivo da Goma em parceria com o Munic\u00edpio da P\u00f3voa de Lanhoso e a Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Braga. A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui dorsal com chip (provas competitivas), seguro de acidentes pessoais, abastecimentos l\u00edquidos e s\u00f3lidos, banhos\/vesti\u00e1rios e oferta oficial da 10\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o para pagamentos at\u00e9 29 de novembro.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"X - Trail das Andorinhas 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-12-13\", \"endDate\": \"2026-12-13\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Parque Desportivo das Andorinhas, Sobradelo da Goma\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"P\u00f3voa de Lanhoso\", \"addressRegion\": \"Braga\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"O X - Trail das Andorinhas 2026 realiza-se a 13 de dezembro na P\u00f3voa de Lanhoso. Provas de 28 km, 16 km, Caminhada 5 km e Kids. Consulta o guia e inscreve-te!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-trail-das-andorinhas.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Trail Longo 28K\", \"price\": \"18.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/sinctime.com\/evento\/563\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Trail Curto 16K\", \"price\": \"0\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/sinctime.com\/evento\/563\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Caminhada 5K\", \"price\": \"6.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/sinctime.com\/evento\/563\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Trail Kids (Benjamins e Infantis)\", \"price\": \"0\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/sinctime.com\/evento\/563\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Trail Kids (Iniciados e Ju